                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "705bf86a-9978-3809-970c-01149d2906f1",
                        "entry_id": "853ebf67-96c2-3cef-92c7-b29e921778b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a squirrel.",
                            "Eccentric."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d23ac010-306f-4f4d-90b9-0b2f36a4ae4d",
                                "sense_id": "705bf86a-9978-3809-970c-01149d2906f1",
                                "text": "Mom can act a bit squirrelly sometimes, and I swear it's usually worse after sunset."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2314e6b6-796f-4909-be4d-42dc0d2846fa",
                                "sense_id": "705bf86a-9978-3809-970c-01149d2906f1",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: batty, nuts, nutty; see also Thesaurus:eccentric, Thesaurus:insane"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e023496-aff6-4d6c-ae3b-30f6fae7f8b0",
                                "sense_id": "705bf86a-9978-3809-970c-01149d2906f1",
                                "text": "Craphound had wicked yard-sale karma, for a rotten, filthy alien bastard. He was too good at panning out the single grain of gold in a raging river of uselessness for me not to like him — respect him, anyway. But then he found the cowboy trunk. It was two months' rent to me and nothing but some squirrelly alien kitsch-fetish to Craphound."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a57858d3-0d16-4b58-8172-8baa41aa18ec",
                                "sense_id": "705bf86a-9978-3809-970c-01149d2906f1",
                                "text": "Dreyfuss wrote that \"it seems far more likely to me that the perpetrator of the bungled Times Square bomb plot was either a lone nut job or a member of some squirrely branch of the Tea Party, anti-government far right. […].\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cdaa709e-cd6b-37ea-9dcd-76eda9a882a1",
                        "entry_id": "853ebf67-96c2-3cef-92c7-b29e921778b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a squirrel.",
                            "Unpredictable or jumpy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e423e85-36e9-4182-8bff-a70b313d2be2",
                                "sense_id": "cdaa709e-cd6b-37ea-9dcd-76eda9a882a1",
                                "text": "\"This aircraft seems to be acting a bit squirrelly,\" the pilot complained uneasily to his copilot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbf54834-7a67-4835-80cf-f0755d956b90",
                                "sense_id": "cdaa709e-cd6b-37ea-9dcd-76eda9a882a1",
                                "text": "\"We got bumped. We got thumped,\" an American pilot was heard saying. A U.S. pilot also reported that a Chinese plane was \"squirrely. Not real steady.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7d431ae-ff5d-4a8c-875e-c04f20fa2f94",
                                "sense_id": "cdaa709e-cd6b-37ea-9dcd-76eda9a882a1",
                                "text": "Buscemi relished the chance to portray the squirrelly, volatile crook Carl Showalter, a figure that came together only once the actor got dressed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30cb3b81-6907-47e5-8b80-6ec47b57b1cd",
                                "sense_id": "cdaa709e-cd6b-37ea-9dcd-76eda9a882a1",
                                "text": "I wonder why it didn’t give me a direct quote. I hope it isn’t going to be squirrelly or weird about quotes. Maybe it’s stressed out about copyrighted translations. I’ll try asking for the original."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "135ea001-666c-3604-ae91-9b0fcbba843b",
                        "entry_id": "853ebf67-96c2-3cef-92c7-b29e921778b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a squirrel.",
                            "Literally so."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of an animal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4988a95c-4a77-4868-80ea-915f2b61bd83",
                                "sense_id": "135ea001-666c-3604-ae91-9b0fcbba843b",
                                "text": "Some of these lemurs seem almost squirrelly."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
